e new, your security systems will often break down.\nSo it's up to you to hide, survive, lock yourself down, fix the systems.... or just give up and get eaten.", "summary": "Have you ever wanted to be a night guard at the famous Floppa's dumpling restaurant? Well... You're in luck, the new restaurant just needs a night guard to protect the place and the animals, but wait, that's not all... In this game you will have to survive with famous cats of Russian and English memes and much more! Interested? Then join our big FLOPPA Family dinner!", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/five-nights-with-floppa-r", "videos": [{"id": 163343, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "tH2fYxsznxs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tH2fYxsznxs", "title": "FNWF:R Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tH2fYxsznxs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 163344, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "fBf1hznwHQ0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fBf1hznwHQ0", "title": "FNwF : R VHS \"Grand_opening.mpeg\"", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fBf1hznwHQ0/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}